{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787118521983214001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"chartreuse-interested-viper","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"0950abb427329507ada701c0bfdbf1bc97bb6cc80620181f075e8c43dc794288","event_uuid":"886731ac-1d40-4bcf-9bb8-dab75b0035be","position":{"commit_sha":"45c0196cc03e5d98945ccbb596d2be993e42d745","position":"1787115283063139001-886731ac-1d40-4bcf-9bb8-dab75b0035be"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"2b9dd3910ad7f854d76fc257f91f566d55873bb73eed424a33b355c7c40a9a67","event_uuid":"df651811-617d-4e89-bdd1-6d0f1905447c","position":{"commit_sha":"5f046dd12eed545da545ef0948c2105dde80d1be","position":"1787115306811265001-df651811-617d-4e89-bdd1-6d0f1905447c"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787115283063139001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"df651811-617d-4e89-bdd1-6d0f1905447c","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"fd48-7a80-33e9-4400"}],"description":"## Report (from a rebar client)\nA Rebar CLI quirk treated `create task --help` as a literal task and created an accidental placeholder ticket.\n\n## Observed\nRunning `rebar create task --help` (an attempt to view help for the create-task command) does NOT print help — instead the parser consumes `--help` as the positional title argument, so a ticket titled `--help` (a placeholder) is actually CREATED.\n\n## Expected\n`create task --help` (and `--help`/`-h` on any create subcommand) should print the command's usage/help and create NOTHING. Help must never be interpreted as ticket content.\n\n## Impact\nAccidental placeholder tickets pollute the store and require cleanup; the write side-effect on a help request is surprising and violates least-astonishment.\n\n## Notes / possible cause\nThe create command path likely reads the first positional as the title before any --help interception. Compare with the argparse standardization landed for the write commands (claim/transition, ticket fd48-7a80-33e9-4400): --help there is served byte-exact by the top-level dispatcher and never reaches the handler. The create path may bypass that dispatcher help interception, or accept a bare positional that swallows `--help`. Needs repro + root-cause.\n\n## Repro\n1. `rebar create task --help`\n2. Observe: no help text; a new ticket titled `--help` is created (verify via `rebar list`).","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","fd48-7a80-33e9-4400"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"b8de-7cf7-370e-4379","ticket_type":"bug","title":"create task --help treated as a literal task title, creating an accidental placeholder ticket","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["886731ac-1d40-4bcf-9bb8-dab75b0035be","df651811-617d-4e89-bdd1-6d0f1905447c"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787118521983214001,"uuid":"7da997a4-bb18-4366-a6e9-ca316c99809c"}